1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
Before you reveal the
answer, write

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,200
one line of reasoning.

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,320
Compare it with the
explanation.

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,240
Was the method wrong,
or did

5
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,520
you lose a sign?

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,060
Mark the question to
revisit, then try it again

7
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,520
without the solution.

8
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,180
The useful result of a
practice session is

9
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,740
knowing what to do
differently on

10
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:17,934
the next attempt.
